<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Arizona State University’s Admission Services about your transfer credits. We have resolved your transfer credit issue in our system. It may take up to five business days for the change to appear in your DARS audit report.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any additional questions on course requirements, please contact the advising office for your major. <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/">View major maps and advising contact information for your degree program</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="mailto:transfercredit@asu.edu">transfercredit@asu.edu</a></font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>